[{"id":"CN-MOD-001","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP/1.1","持久连接","分帧"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":13,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP/1.1 持久连接为什么要求严格理解消息分帧？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>一条 TCP 连接承载多个请求/响应，双方必须准确知道每条消息的内容边界；常见依据是状态语义、Content-Length、chunked 或连接关闭。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>长度字段冲突或代理解析不一致可能导致等待、响应拼接或请求走私。持久连接解决复用，不自动解决边界。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>持久连接的关键是能确定每条消息在哪里结束：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>边界依据\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>适用线索\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>风险\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Content-Length\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>已知长度的消息\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>长度冲突\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>chunked\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>分块传输\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>代理解析不一致\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>连接关闭\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>响应结束\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>无法继续复用\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>连接复用只解决“重复建连接”的成本，不会替应用协议修复模糊边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-visual-baseline","type":"basic","priority":3,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["视觉回归","基线"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/4504d456/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/4504d456/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>什么时候可以更新视觉回归基线？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>需求变化已批准，并人工审查 current、diff 和对应平台后。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>基线更新是评审动作，不是失败后的自动修复。业务断言、ARIA 合同和受支持平台都必须继续满足要求。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>更新基线前要把“变化”与“回归”分开：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>证据\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>用来判断\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>current\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>当前实现实际画面\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>diff\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>哪些像素发生变化\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>需求/评审记录\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>变化是否被批准\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>平台矩阵\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>变化是否只在某浏览器出现\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>失败后自动覆盖基线会删除回归证据；基线更新必须经过人工审查并保留原因。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-coverage-not-correctness","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["质量证据"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告","articlePath":"posts/51d93cec/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告","articlePath":"posts/51d93cec/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>覆盖率高为什么不等于测试正确？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>覆盖率只说明代码路径被执行，不说明断言是否有效、输入是否代表真实边界或结果是否正确。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>覆盖率记录的是执行路径，不是断言质量。下面两条测试都可能增加语句覆盖率，但第一条没有证明结果：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_runs\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    calculate_discount(\u003cspan class=\"number\">100\u003c/span>)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 执行了代码，却没有观察结果\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_boundary\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> calculate_discount(\u003cspan class=\"number\">100\u003c/span>) == \u003cspan class=\"number\">90\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 才形成行为证据\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>分支覆盖率也不能证明外部协议、数据质量或错误消息符合业务契约。应把覆盖率当作查找未触达路径的导航，再和边界断言、集成测试、失败回溯及业务验收一起判断质量。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-container-list-tuple","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","list","tuple","容器"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(四)内置类型与容器.md","articleTitle":"Python(四)内置类型与容器","articlePath":"posts/c43fdd4/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(四)内置类型与容器.md","articleTitle":"Python(四)内置类型与容器","articlePath":"posts/c43fdd4/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>列表和元组如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>需要原地增删改时选列表；表示固定、有序记录且不应修改时选元组。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>两者都保持顺序，但修改边界不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">items = [\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;draft&quot;\u003c/span>]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">items.append(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;published&quot;\u003c/span>)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 列表适合逐步累积\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">point = (\u003cspan class=\"number\">120\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">80\u003c/span>)            \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 元组表达固定记录\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">mapping = &#123;point: \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;cursor&quot;\u003c/span>&#125; \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 元组元素可哈希时可作为键\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>列表适合拥有明确写入者的可变集合；元组更适合固定结构、不可变记录。元组能否作为键还取决于所有元素是否可哈希，例如 \u003ccode>(1, [])\u003c/code> 仍然不能作为键。选择依据是数据关系和所有权，不是方法数量。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]